{
 "version": "2.0.0",
 "notes": [
  "Single entity registry serving title, lead and source classification for ALL outlets and ALL periods (PREREGISTRATION.md section 7).",
  "Each pattern is a regex FRAGMENT compiled by classification.py inside Ukrainian word-boundary lookarounds — substring matching is impossible by construction.",
  "Patterns use explicit inflected forms for short/collision-prone words and stem+suffix for long unambiguous stems.",
  "categories: ukrainian_official | foreign_official.",
  "foreign_context patterns are NOT entities: when one co-occurs inside an extracted source span, the span is classified foreign_official regardless of other matches (a defense against 'міністр оборони Німеччини' counting as a Ukrainian minister — v1 anti-pattern)."
 ],
 "decision_log": [
  "Зеленська (перша леді) NOT included: not a посадовець exercising state power; ІМІ's parket wording targets officials.",
  "мер / міськрада / облрада included (regional officialdom) — v1 silently dropped 'мер'; restored with strict full-form matching.",
  "депутат included as ukrainian_official but overridden to foreign_official by foreign_context co-occurrence (депутат Бундестагу).",
  "Ощадбанк/Приватбанк/Укрпошта excluded: state-owned enterprises' commercial announcements are not officialdom in ІМІ's parket sense; Укрзалізниця/Укренерго/Нафтогаз/Енергоатом kept because their wartime communiqués are governmental in practice. Sensitivity to this choice is not tested — declared in Limitations.",
  "суд/суддя excluded (judiciary rarely the subject of parket coverage; high collision risk of 'суд' inside quotes); Верховний Суд and КСУ kept as institutions."
 ],
